        "chars": 111,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.92
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        271,
        1491,
        1673,
        1577
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Executive Order No. 30, dated May 2, 1956, dealt with one\nphase of this subject, performance standards and workloads.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2403,
          "min": -1.4027
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 34,
          "mean": -0.0035,
          "min": -0.1151
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 11369,
        "area_px": 122583,
        "density": 0.09275,
        "chars": 117,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.29
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        263,
        1618,
        1718,
        2003
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In my Second Annual Report, made public in March of this\nyear, improvement of departmental reporting was set forth as one of\nour goals for 1956. We pledged \"to complete installation in all city\ndepartments of a revised management reporting system, and simultan-\neously to encourage the development of performance yardsticks in the\ndepartments. These advances will make possible objective appraisal\nof the efficiency of municipal agencies, provide essential tools for\nmanagement improvements, and assist in the establishment of a program\nperformance budget for the City.\"",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2876,
          "min": -1.3806
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 117,
          "mean": -0.0016,
          "min": -0.1137
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 47911,
        "area_px": 561408,
        "density": 0.08534,
        "chars": 570,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 11.9
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        260,
        2042,
        1746,
        2140
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The task falls into two parts, one being developed by\nthe City Administrator's Office, the other by the Bureau of the Budget.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2494,
          "min": -1.4205
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 27,
          "mean": -0.0011,
          "min": -0.0289
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 10312,
        "area_px": 146118,
        "density": 0.07057,
        "chars": 125,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 12.12
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        250,
        2171,
        1710,
        2435
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The management reporting system devised by the City\nAdministrator is intended to provide a means by which the Mayor, the\nCity Administrator, and the department head can, through periodic\noperational reports, keep apprised of accomplishments and progress\nwith respect to the primary mission of the agency, and the effective-\nness of its administrative management.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2627,
          "min": -1.2763
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
